GET по id:

curl -i -u admin:admin123 http://localhost:8080/api/cars/1

POST (создать запись):

Git Bash:
curl -i -u admin:admin123 -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{ "brand":"VW","model":"Polo","color":"white","year":2021,"price":525252 }' http://localhost:8080/api/cars

В ответе увидишь JSON созданной записи с id. Запомни id.

PUT (обновить запись):

Подставь id из шага POST:
curl -i -u admin:admin123 -X PUT -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{ "brand":"VW","model":"Polo","color":"black","year":2021,"price":560000 }' http://localhost:8080/api/cars/4

GET по id (проверка после PUT):

curl -i -u admin:admin123 http://localhost:8080/api/cars/4

DELETE (удалить запись):

curl -i -u admin:admin123 -X DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cars/4

Повторный GET по id (должен быть 404):

curl -i -u admin:admin123 http://localhost:8080/api/cars/<ID>